  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Lua: don't define unused static inline functions in the debugger.",
  "description": "If we're using Lua 5.3 or earlier, we don't flip the allow hook, so we\ndon't use the routines that set or get the state of the allow hook.\nDon't define them, as that gets compiler warnings.\n\nMake WSLUA_DBG_HAS_ALLOWHOOK_FLIP just a Boolean, as the name suggests\nit is; define it if we have the routines to get and set the allow hook,\notherwise don't define it.",
